# The personal assistant's model (T71): qwen3:8b with a 32,768-token window set on the model itself.
# OpenCode talks to Ollama through the OpenAI-compatible endpoint, which cannot set a window per request, and
# a prompt that does not fit is cut from the front without an error. A model of its own pins the window
# whatever Ollama's default is, and touches nothing else on the host (Duet's models keep theirs).
# Created by tools/host/ollama-pa-model.sh.
FROM qwen3:8b
PARAMETER num_ctx 32768
